+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project uses Semantic Versioning (SemVer, `MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH`) for release version numbers. It was chosen because its structured versioning integrates better with standard dependency management practices and the package managers and build tools that resolve dependencies, which suits a library used by other projects.
